      "content": [{ "attachment": { "contentType": "text/plain", "text": "Fell approximately 2 feet from a step stool, striking the right side on a countertop. Radiographs: nondisplaced fractures of the right 6th and 7th ribs; no pneumothorax. SpO2 95% on room air; COPD history. Pain controlled. Discharged with incentive spirometer and analgesia; follow up with primary care." } }] } },
